## Data Flow Diagram

```
User Registers → Sets Preferences → Saved to Users collection
                                          ↓
                              User searches "Kandy"
                                          ↓
                   Server fetches preferences for logged-in user
                                          ↓
                         Scores each result (static weights)
                                          ↓
                   Sorts: preference-matched first, others after
                                          ↓
                     Frontend shows ✨ badge on matched items
                                          ↓
                            User taps "Kandy Lake"
                                          ↓
                      Behaviour logged: { category: "Scenic", ... }
                                          ↓
                    Next search: behaviour weights added to score
                                          ↓
                      "Scenic" places rank even higher next time
```

